%% IMAGO-2 — One consultation under the fabric (Primer 0 §4 successor). Status: Proposed
%% Grammar note: sequenceDiagram treats ";" in message text as a statement terminator — none used below.
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Patient + Clinician
  participant C as Coder
  participant A as Engine A
  participant F as Conformal F
  participant E as Graph E
  participant V as Evaluator + gates
  participant G as Fabric ledger
  participant U as Faces x3
  P->>C: free text
  C->>A: coded findings = grounds, with provenance
  A->>A: priors + LR chain (warrant) + red-flag overrides
  A->>F: posteriors + trace
  F->>E: conformal set = qualifier (SPINE-2)
  E->>V: fragment pointers + prune rebuttals + DetectedIssues
  V->>V: hash, tier, currency, range, context + argument checks
  Note over V: SPINE-2 refusals — no qualifier: refuse.<br/>Empty rebuttal slot while findings exist: refuse.
  V->>G: ActualArgument appended — hash-chained (SPINE-4), pinned (SPINE-5)
  G->>U: one argument, three registers (SPINE-3 invariance)
  P->>G: accept or override — Deviation object (SPINE-8)
